{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"自由黨領導層換屆取消黨魁　邵家輝連任主席\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/LIBERAL-CHANGE-261115-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】自由黨領導層換屆，立法會批發及零售界議員邵家輝繼續擔任黨主席，而黨魁一職就取消。</p><p>除了邵家輝連任主席外，黨內新設常務副主席由立法會議員李鎮強及陳曉峰出任，原本只有三名的副主席將會增至四名，包括立法會議員梁進、港區全國政協施維雄、東區區議員阮建中及自由之友主席林佑碧。</p><p>至於黨魁一職就會取消，原本擔任黨魁的張宇人則會保留中委一職。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:23:01.808821+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:24:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:56:59.126682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:39.112919+00:00","content_hash":"2205ceb1c6182c838ef59df041cfd3bb9b4710c38c80686c344169b591746174","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":"fetch failed: TimeoutError","content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:23:01.808821+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-fetch-error","latest_error":"fetch failed: TimeoutError"},"content_capture":null}